        "action_date": "2025-03-04",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Help Ensure Legal Detainers Act or the HELD Act</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits the use of federal funds by a state or local subdivision that has in effect a law, policy, or procedure that prevents or impedes</p><ul><li>a timely response to a request from U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement&nbsp;(ICE)  for information about an alien in state or local custody, including the alien's estimated release date; or</li><li>compliance with a request from ICE to hold an alien for up to 48 hours so that ICE may assume custody.</li></ul>",
        "update_date": "2026-04-03T15:39:21Z"
      }
    ]
  },
